{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Pistachio Knight** is a 2D action platformer inspired by classic 90s games. Play as Pistachio, the mysterious knight who must defeat Akurg, the leader who ruined his vacation and came to control all the planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Make your way across diverse planets, confronting enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic side-scrolling gameplay with modern controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse levels that don't focus on just one type of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique boss battles that require focus and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stunning graphics and sound effects that replace the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore planets with challenging levels and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Playtime: 2 to 4 hours, depending on your skill.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437680?t=1757706532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437680/59f9debd9d0e27749e08e0d87de4226b9e485693/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757706532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437680/58fd2b2ba13d23e131459040918403bf9fd8201d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757706532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437680/58fd2b2ba13d23e131459040918403bf9fd8201d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757706532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Pistachio Knight** is a 2D action platformer inspired by classic 90s games. Play as Pistachio, the mysterious knight who must defeat Akurg, the leader who ruined his vacation and came to control all the planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Make your way across diverse planets, confronting enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic side-scrolling gameplay with modern controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse levels that don't focus on just one type of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique boss battles that require focus and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stunning graphics and sound effects that replace the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore planets with challenging levels and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Playtime: 2 to 4 hours, depending on your skill.</p>","developers":["GameZ"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437680/ddc155586c82fce147619c548c873cbf4b21f06a/header.jpg?t=1757706532","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437680/55449120/83aa2b98d4e0bc0df6071ac5c79488009a851349/1754028644/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754546983","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437680/55449120/83aa2b98d4e0bc0df6071ac5c79488009a851349/1754028644/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754546983","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437680/55449120/83aa2b98d4e0bc0df6071ac5c79488009a851349/1754028644/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754546983","id":257176604,"name":"Trailer","thu